MAIN
MOVE TEMP 14 4
MOVE TEMP 15 HALLOCATE TEMP 14
MOVE TEMP 9 TEMP 15
MOVE TEMP 16 4
MOVE TEMP 17 HALLOCATE TEMP 16
MOVE TEMP 10 TEMP 17
MOVE TEMP 18 A_start
HSTORE TEMP 10 0 TEMP 18
MOVE TEMP 19 TEMP 10
HSTORE TEMP 9 0 TEMP 19
MOVE TEMP 8 TEMP 9
HLOAD TEMP 11 TEMP 8 0
HLOAD TEMP 12 TEMP 11 0
MOVE TEMP 20 CALL TEMP 12 ( TEMP 8 )
PRINT TEMP 20
END
A_start [ 1 ]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 21 1
MOVE TEMP 1 TEMP 21
MOVE TEMP 22 2
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 22
MOVE TEMP 23 3
MOVE TEMP 3 TEMP 23
MOVE TEMP 24 4
MOVE TEMP 4 TEMP 24
MOVE TEMP 25 10
MOVE TEMP 5 TEMP 25
MOVE TEMP 26 20
MOVE TEMP 6 TEMP 26
MOVE TEMP 27 30
MOVE TEMP 7 TEMP 27
MOVE TEMP 28 0
MOVE TEMP 13 TEMP 28
MOVE TEMP 29 PLUS TEMP 3 TEMP 4
MOVE TEMP 30 TIMES TEMP 2 TEMP 29
MOVE TEMP 31 PLUS TEMP 1 TEMP 30
MOVE TEMP 32 PLUS TEMP 6 TEMP 7
MOVE TEMP 33 MINUS TEMP 5 TEMP 32
MOVE TEMP 34 LE TEMP 31 TEMP 33
CJUMP TEMP 34 L0
MOVE TEMP 35 2
MOVE TEMP 36 LE TEMP 1 TEMP 35
CJUMP TEMP 36 L0
MOVE TEMP 37 1
MOVE TEMP 13 TEMP 37
L0  NOOP
CJUMP TEMP 13 L1
MOVE TEMP 38 1
PRINT TEMP 38
JUMP L2
L1 MOVE TEMP 39 0
PRINT TEMP 39
L2  NOOP
MOVE TEMP 40 0

